code: 0
--- stdout
A pull request waits for review

  From:      In progress, Ready
  To:        In review; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Optional:  --comment
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Labels:    +enhancement -dogfood (+ adds, - removes)
  Assign:    you (the authenticated user); other assignees stay
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo review <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for review

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
